  2009-01-01 12:00  => TRANSFO-DATE-66B.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>******************
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-A6-Y1 = ';'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE '0'      TO WS-A6-Y1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-RECORD-TRANSFORME-66B-200X
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO TRANSFO-DATE-66B-EXIT.
