  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC XX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PN-TEXT        PIC X(37).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X(41).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PARM-MAX-REC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC XX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PX-MAX         PIC 9(10).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X(68).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  TAPEIN
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD IS STANDARD
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     RECORD VARYING IN SIZE FROM 1 TO 4001
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DEPENDING ON WS-IN-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  REC-IN             PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  PRT      LABEL RECORD IS OMITTED  DATA RECORD IS PRT-LINE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PRT-LINE          PIC X(100)          USAGE  DISPLAY-1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  RECIN              PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  REC-AREA           PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-CHUNK           PIC X(100).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-IN-LEN          PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CP-LEN             PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-LEN              PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
