  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  K                  PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  KP                 PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  SKIP                         PIC  9(10)  COMP VALUE 0.
