  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE  PRT-LINE  FROM  PRINT-LINE-301  AFTER ADVANCING SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO LINE-CNT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE  PRT-LINE  FROM  PRINT-LINE-401  AFTER ADVANCING SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO LINE-CNT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE  PRT-LINE  FROM  PRINT-LINE-501  AFTER ADVANCING SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO LINE-CNT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE  PRT-LINE  FROM  PRINT-LINE-601  AFTER ADVANCING SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO LINE-CNT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE  PRT-LINE  FROM  PRINT-LINE-701  AFTER ADVANCING SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO LINE-CNT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE  PRT-LINE  FROM  PRINT-LINE-801  AFTER ADVANCING SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO LINE-CNT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO SKIP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES  TO REC-AREA.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE  1  TO  SKIP.     GO  TO  LR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => END-OUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE  REC-IN-CT  TO  M-CT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE REC-FOUND-CT  TO  FN-CT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE PRT-LINE  FROM  M-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 10 LINES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE  TAPEIN  PRT.
